<title>SWITZERLAND: Bank Baer gives rate, bond yield forecasts.</title>
<headline>Bank Baer gives rate, bond yield forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Julius Baer gave these forecasts for interest and currency rates and bond yields:</p>
<p>		     Three-month Eurorates	10-year govt bonds</p>
<p>			current  6-month fcst     current 6-month fcst</p>
<p> Switzerland	 1.88     1.80		  3.89   4.00</p>
<p> Germany	     3.13     3.20		  5.80   6.10</p>
<p> Netherlands	 2.98     3.10		  5.72   6.05</p>
<p> France		3.39     3.30		  5.79   6.10</p>
<p> UK		    6.34     6.80		  7.50   7.50</p>
<p> Italy		 7.19     6.50		  7.52   7.70</p>
<p> ECU*		  4.13     4.10		  5.86   6.10</p>
<p> USA		   5.44     5.40		  6.16   6.20</p>
<p> Canada		3.03     3.40		  6.13   6.30</p>
<p> Australia	   6.45     6.30		  7.09   7.00</p>
<p> Japan		 0.36     0.90		  2.60   3.20</p>
<p>* - calculated according to EMS basket weighting Currency vs Swiss Franc</p>
<p>			     current  6-month forecast</p>
<p> Switzerland		 --		--</p>
